This test produce a short HREM trajectory for solvated FKB12 with ligand using the OpenMP/MPI 
(2 threads 4 MPI process) 

The input file is md.in
the starting conf of the FKBP12-ligand is the file in start.pdb 
potential parameters are in the directory ../ff/

To run this test  just do form this directory 

mpirun -n 4 ../../src/GNU-FFTW-OMP-MPI/orac < rem.in > rem.out

The test should produce the directories TST0001-4 containing the output for the
four walkers 

each dir contains the following

1.rem            diagnostic file with scaled energies 
ij4i.xyz         xyz of the protein-ligand  only 
md_1.pdb         full trajectory including the solvent 
out0001          general output file gromacs/like for the walker 
REM_DIAGNOSTIC   other diagnostic file with scaled energies 

Reference output is in the directories PAR0001-4
